msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "conceptHoldsFor is functional"
msgstr "conceptHoldsFor 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:conceptHoldsFor is functional: one gmeow:ConceptTenure records the intension of exactly one concept, so the tenure binds to a single concept even though a concept may accrue many tenures over time."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:conceptHoldsFor 是函数式的：一个 gmeow:ConceptTenure 恰好记录一个概念的内涵，因此该存续期绑定于唯一一个概念，尽管一个概念随时间可能积累许多个存续期。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:conceptHoldsFor names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:conceptHoldsFor 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:conceptHoldsFor, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:conceptHoldsFor, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:conceptHoldsForFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:conceptHoldsFor ."
msgstr "gmeow:conceptHoldsForFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:conceptHoldsFor ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/conceptHoldsForFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:conceptHoldsFor and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:conceptHoldsFor (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:conceptHoldsFor 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:conceptHoldsFor 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"
